---
title: 02 - Customer flow of a box, part 1 - start, checking the container, mode, coins (same for Box 1, 2 and 3)
---
flowchart TD
  classDef cStart fill:#111111,stroke:#111111,color:#ffffff
  classDef cSide fill:#ffffff,stroke:#111111,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray:5 4,color:#111111
  classDef cFault fill:#ffffff,stroke:#111111,stroke-width:4px,color:#111111
  classDef cLink fill:#ffffff,stroke:#111111,stroke-width:2px,color:#111111

  TAPS(["START SCREEN<br/>TAP anywhere to START"]):::cStart
  CC["CHECKING MAIN CONTAINER<br/>Please wait, 2 seconds"]
  W["WELCOME<br/>Tap to START"]
  D{"on the tap: is the Refilling Station heard<br/>(in the last 15 s) and is this box's<br/>main container MID, HIGH or MAX?"}
  M{"SELECT MODE<br/>CLEANING or DRYING"}
  MD{"SELECT MODE, dry only<br/>CLEANING is greyed out"}
  COIN["INSERT COIN<br/>15 coins = 5 min, more coins add time<br/>coin slot ON"]
  CAN["CANCEL?<br/>coins will not be refunded"]:::cSide
  NEXT(["to part 2<br/>OPEN THE DOOR"]):::cLink
  MEMO["EMPTY OR LOW CONTAINER, OR THE STATION IS SILENT:<br/>the box offers DRYING only.<br/>The Refilling Station fills the container by itself<br/>(one valve at a time, EMPTY first).<br/>Nobody has to do anything: the next customer<br/>gets CLEANING again as soon as it reads MID or more."]:::cSide

  subgraph OTHER["OTHER SCREENS"]
    OOO["OUT OF ORDER<br/>S3 silent: the screen shows it by itself<br/>helmet or door sensor board, or relay board, silent:<br/>the main controller shows it<br/>(entered by the firmware, before any coin is taken)<br/>a helmet shut inside is released: the lock opens and the buzzer beeps"]:::cFault
    MNT["MAINTENANCE<br/>switched on from the LocalServer page"]:::cSide
  end

  TAPS -->|tap| CC
  CC -->|after 2 s| W
  W -->|tap| D
  D -->|yes| M
  D -->|"no: EMPTY, LOW,<br/>or the station is not heard"| MD
  M -->|CLEANING button| COIN
  M -->|DRYING button| COIN
  MD -->|DRYING button| COIN
  MD -.- MEMO
  COIN -->|CANCEL| CAN
  CAN -->|YES| TAPS
  CAN -->|NO| COIN
  COIN -->|enough coins| NEXT
